    "updated_at": "2026-11-06T19:58:15Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the analysis! Yeah I think this seems compatible.\n\n> Testable hits were loaded in Firefox with `dom.forms.retain_focus_on_disabled.enabled`\n\nThat was fast! @keithamus did you implement this in firefox? Was there anything tricky about implementing it?",
