    "updated_at": "2026-11-06T22:41:35Z",
    "body": "> That was fast! [@keithamus](https://github.com/keithamus) did you implement this in firefox? Was there anything tricky about implementing it?\n\nYeah it's not fully baked, but it didn't take much for what's landed so far: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338087 - mostly setting a flag in the elements to check during focus steps. There's a bunch of knock on stuff from this though; we need to [ignore key events](https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338542), [close pickers](https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338543), [stop autocomplete](https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338545), and also [keep focus on the sub-elements in inputs like date](https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338541)",
